WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 6ff1da8907b7499eb2c565476fd62b73

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.940
Karibu tena. Hadi sasa, tunapofikiria kuhusu

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:05.540
string au namba, tumekuwa tukiziona kama

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:10.140
vitu visivyobadilika. Na ingawa ni hivyo,

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:13.260
pia zina utendaji mwingi uliojengwa ndani yao

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:16.240
ambao Jiki anaweza kutumia. Na tunaposonga

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.790
mbele, tutajifunza kuhusu utendaji huu,

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:20.940
kuhusu uwezo huu ambao string na namba zinao,

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:23.690
unaofanya maisha yako kuwa rahisi zaidi. Na

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.100
kuna aina mbili za uwezo

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:30.220
tutakaozungumzia: sifa na metodu. Hebu tuanze

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:34.750
kwa kuangalia sifa. Sifa ni ukweli

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.370
tunaoweza kumwomba Jiki atuambie kuhusu

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:40.800
vitu. Kwa mfano, string zina sifa

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:43.500
inayoitwa length (urefu), ambayo Jiki anaweza kutumia

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.020
kutuambia urefu wa string. Kwa hivyo, badala

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:48.100
ya kutumia kitanzi kupitia herufi zote

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:50.380
ili kujua ukubwa wa string,

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:52.300
tunaweza kumwomba Jiki atuambie tu.

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:55.620
Na ili kufanya hivi, tunatumia mtindo

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:59.080
mpya wa sintaksia: nukta. Kwa mfano, kama

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:01.460
tuna string Jeremy na tunataka

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:05.540
kupata urefu wake, tunaweza kuandika Jeremy.length,

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:10.200
na hiyo ndiyo yote. Jiki anapounda string,

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:12.500
huhesabu herufi na kuandika tu

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:14.240
namba ya herufi hizo

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:16.580
kwenye kona. Na kisha tunapotumia

00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:19.960
sifa length, Jiki huenda tu kuangalia

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:23.130
namba hiyo ilikuwa nini. Kwa hivyo katika mfano wetu wa Jeremy.length,

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:27.480
Jiki anapounda string Jeremy,

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:29.510
huhesabu herufi, anaandika namba sita

00:01:29.540 --> 00:01:32.580
kwenye kona, na kisha tunapoandika Jeremy.length,

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:35.060
huenda kuangalia. Kwa hivyo unaweza

00:01:35.080 --> 00:01:37.980
kufikiria sifa kama ukweli kuhusu

00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:41.160
kitu hicho. Sasa, nilisema tuna sifa

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:44.880
na metodu, kwa hivyo metodu ni nini? Metodu ni

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:49.590
vitendakazi ambavyo ni mali ya string. Kwa hiyo, badala

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:52.120
ya sisi kuandika kitendakazi tunachoweka

00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:54.960
string ndani yake kama ingizo, tunaweza

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:59.020
kutumia metodu moja kwa moja kwenye string. Kwa

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:01.700
mfano, unakumbuka kitendakazi ulichoandika ambapo

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:04.700
ulihakiki kama string ina herufi fulani

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:07.580
ndani yake? Basi, kwa kweli string zina

00:02:07.720 --> 00:02:11.320
metodu inayoitwa includes inayofanya hivyo, na

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:13.440
tunaweza kuitumia kwa sintaksia ile ile ya nukta

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:16.530
uliyoona kwa sifa. Tofauti ni kwamba

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:18.280
tunapoziandika, tunaziandika kama

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:21.989
vitendakazi vyenye mabano na maingizo. Kwa hiyo tunaweza

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:26.520
kuandika, na tutapata true kama matokeo, kwa sababu Jeremy

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:28.840
ina E ndani yake. Sasa, metodu hizi ni

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:31.840
tofauti na sifa kwa sababu si mambo tulivu.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:34.680
Kwa kweli ni vitendakazi. Unaweza kuzifikiria

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:37.260
kama vitendakazi vilivyo na sanduku lililojengwa ndani yake

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:40.850
lenye string ndani. Jinsi zinavyofanya

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:43.150
kazi haijalishi kwa sasa. Bado

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:45.200
muda mrefu kabla ya kuzijenga. Unachohitaji

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:47.720
kujua ni kwamba unatumia

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:50.200
metodu kwa kuandika nukta kisha

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:53.070
sintaksia ya kawaida ya kitendakazi. Jambo moja la kujua

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:55.160
kuhusu string ni kwamba metodu hazibadilishi

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:58.400
chochote ndani ya string. Kwa mfano, kuna

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:01.560
metodu toUpperCase, ambayo inarejesha string yenye

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:04.010
herufi zote kubwa. Lakini hiyo haibadilishi

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:06.960
string ya awali. Hiyo bado ina Jeremy

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:10.100
yenye herufi J kubwa mwanzoni tu. Badala yake, Jiki

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:13.120
anaunda string mpya yenye herufi kubwa zote.

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:16.040
Sasa, tunaposonga mbele, nitakuonyesha

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:18.100
sifa na metodu nyingi tofauti

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:20.810
unazoweza kutumia. Tafadhali soma kwa makini maelekezo ya

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:23.410
mazoezi ili ujifunze kuhusu

00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:26.380
mambo haya yote tofauti. Lakini kwanza, tutarudi

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:29.380
kwenye zoezi la pangram la awali, lakini likiwa na

00:03:29.420 --> 00:03:32.600
ugumu kidogo zaidi. Furahia, na tutaonana

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:33.470
hapa tena hivi karibuni.
